n></figure><figure><img alt=\"搵工｜還是學歷優先嗎？HR分享揀人條件！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250508/997218034823204864218073.jpeg/2YgbxCsALBNgcS1b6T0gL2IuW1Jz7YG5C300Hwt9NB8\"/><figcaption>搵工｜還是學歷優先嗎？HR分享揀人條件！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"搵工｜還是學歷優先嗎？HR分享揀人條件！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250508/997218037075677184237089.jpeg/98_Huzm80kEaDAhn1fw1GsJX9hiLqK5C5vX1TOb19Uw\"/><figcaption>搵工｜還是學歷優先嗎？HR分享揀人條件！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文經《風傳媒》授權轉載，原文：碩士畢業、英文能力強，為何還是找不到工作？他失業4年才發現，少了「1關鍵」學歷再高也沒用】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T08:21:20.566425+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1717,"images":22,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}